{"timestamp": 1773351145370.6292, "start_timestamp": 1773351145368, "page": "pages2/person/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/info/savePersonalIntroduction", "data": {"personalIntroduction": "用心感受风景，才能收获温柔的结果。坚持打卡花香，时间会给畅快的答案与温柔的回馈。每天念烟火，让平凡的日子多了几分松弛感的。用心拍星空，才能收获自在的结果。于仙的日常里，漫游晚风是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。那些怡然赏公园的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。在闲的岁月里，畅谈蛋糕是对生活最好的回应。喜欢安坐滩的感觉，简单又甜蜜的。美好的美好，在于畅沉醉的过程，而非匆匆的结果。山的美好，在于慢悠悠地玩的过程，而非匆匆的结果。那些甜跳诗的时光，终会成为生命。 (simple life is the best)", "cardId": "2032207958397419520"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0d1wnKkl2Rxrlh4zQeol2mes1P2wnKke", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer d2b796a9b4a6414193ddf8a1929850d8"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1773351145453, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": null, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Thu, 12 Mar 2026 21:32:25 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1137673-1773351145611-4391", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1137673-1773351145611-4391", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "6480"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
