{"timestamp": 1773351164849.8567, "start_timestamp": 1773351164678, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/status/commerce/user/info", "data": {"userId": "", "cardId": "2032207958397419520"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0d1wnKkl2Rxrlh4zQeol2mes1P2wnKke", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer d2b796a9b4a6414193ddf8a1929850d8"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1773351164791, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"userId": "", "cardId": "2032207958397419520", "address": "温暖在侧，扛欢喜。宝贵的复盘，准珍藏。醒美。", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "ipArea": "", "mobile": "15722511412", "name": "新早", "nativePlace": {"provinceCode": "52", "province": "贵州省", "cityCode": "5227", "city": "黔南布依族苗族自治州", "areaCode": "522722", "area": "荔波县"}, "personalIntroduction": "用心感受风景，才能收获温柔的结果。坚持打卡花香，时间会给畅快的答案与温柔的回馈。每天念烟火，让平凡的日子多了几分松弛感的。用心拍星空，才能收获自在的结果。于仙的日常里，漫游晚风是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。那些怡然赏公园的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。在闲的岁月里，畅谈蛋糕是对生活最好的回应。喜欢安坐滩的感觉，简单又甜蜜的。美好的美好，在于畅沉醉的过程，而非匆匆的结果。山的美好，在于慢悠悠地玩的过程，而非匆匆的结果。那些甜跳诗的时光，终会成为生命。 (simple life is the best)", "tag1": "渐慢游，诗皆温柔。饼干相。", "tag2": "情绪如诗，认真地。", "wechat": "13651166934", "backUpUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/template/B-B5.png", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png", "portraitUrl": "", "nativePlaceName": ["贵州省", "黔南布依族苗族自治州", "荔波县"], "exchangeStatus": -1, "isMine": 0, "memberStatus": null, "templateId": "9", "styleId": "77", "shareId": "72", "cardIdentityType": 22, "currentIdentityId": "2032208051828068354", "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260313/66a1b96e1ac93d13abbbd23c78f7ac22037075984ae15849a3139fc9456e8ef1.png", "isEditable": 1, "cardType": 30, "isSendCard": 1, "pendingExchangeId": null, "tags": []}, "msg": "处理成功"}, "header": {"Date": "Thu, 12 Mar 2026 21:32:44 GMT", "